# Conclusion

The Supply Chain Analytics project demonstrates the value of integrating SQL-based data engineering with Power BI business intelligence to support strategic decision-making. The recommendations presented in this report address opportunities to improve market performance, optimize inventory, enhance customer retention, strengthen logistics operations, and improve data quality.

Implementing these recommendations will help the organization reduce operational inefficiencies, improve customer satisfaction, and support sustainable long-term business growth through data-driven decision-making.
